  "performanceFeeSeries": {
    "id": "perf-fee-hwm-crystallization-cycle",
    "narrative": "Four valuation periods of a 20% performance fee with a 200,000 currency hurdle against a 10,000,000 opening high-water mark: accrue without crystallizing, crystallize on a lower NAV, sit under water, then recover and crystallize again. The high-water mark only moves on crystallization and only to the post-fee NAV.",
